WEBVTT

01:22.082 --> 01:24.793
OCTOBER 17TH

01:24.876 --> 01:26.544
It's too windy. What did you just say?

01:27.128 --> 01:30.840
Your wife's friend, Son Myeong-o,
keeps calling you, Mr. Ha.

01:31.466 --> 01:33.468
Who? Son Myeong-o?

01:36.346 --> 01:37.347
Ah, shit…

01:37.847 --> 01:40.475
I can't remember anything.
The drugs are wearing off.

01:41.351 --> 01:42.769
What was it?

01:44.562 --> 01:45.688
SON MYEONG-O

01:45.772 --> 01:46.606
Huh?

01:48.024 --> 01:48.858
What?

01:49.442 --> 01:51.277
What's up? I'm a little busy.

01:51.361 --> 01:54.280
Where are you? Let's meet.
Want to come to my place?

01:54.364 --> 01:56.950
You want to see me alone? Why?

01:57.033 --> 01:58.535
There's something I need to ask you

01:58.618 --> 02:01.412
and I need to exchange some cash.
You have US dollars, right?

02:11.589 --> 02:12.882
Hey, are you listening?

02:12.966 --> 02:13.883
Exchange?

02:13.967 --> 02:15.426
How much? Four dollars?

02:15.510 --> 02:18.763
Stop being a jerk
and go jerk yourself off.

02:19.264 --> 02:21.349
Wow, this fucking bitch.

02:23.977 --> 02:25.228
What the fuck did you say?

02:25.311 --> 02:26.729
Ah, that's right.

02:27.605 --> 02:29.691
You probably wouldn't remember, would you?

02:30.191 --> 02:32.026
You were crawling on all fours
like a bitch.

02:33.403 --> 02:35.446
I'll make sure to send you
the video as a gift.

02:36.322 --> 02:39.200
By the way,
you were there that day, weren't you?

02:39.284 --> 02:40.535
The day So-hee died.

02:41.411 --> 02:43.913
You saw her fall, and bolted
without calling the cops, right?

02:44.497 --> 02:47.333
What the fuck? What're you talking about?

02:47.834 --> 02:50.503
Of course I didn't call.
I was high on glue.

02:50.587 --> 02:53.423
I'm hanging up. I'm busy.
Quit bothering me.

02:55.008 --> 02:56.801
Wow, she's so shameless. Shit.

02:57.302 --> 02:58.261
Bullying bitch.

03:02.599 --> 03:04.517
OCTOBER 18TH

03:18.573 --> 03:22.577
JERKFACE JAE-JUN

03:22.660 --> 03:25.079
How are you feeling, Mr. Jeon?

03:25.705 --> 03:27.749
You know, being bitten by your own dog?

03:27.832 --> 03:30.001
You fucker, where the hell are you?

03:30.084 --> 03:32.086
Where else would I be?
I'm always with you.

03:32.170 --> 03:34.255
All right. You must be high on drugs.

03:34.339 --> 03:35.673
What the hell did you send me?

03:35.757 --> 03:38.593
You should know that already.
It's a record of your embezzlement.

03:38.676 --> 03:42.263
The ledger proving how you lied
about starting a club in the Philippines.

03:42.805 --> 03:44.641
I'll make this quick.

03:44.724 --> 03:47.185
I'll keep my mouth shut
for some of your crypto.

03:47.769 --> 03:49.270
One Bitcoin for each page.

03:49.354 --> 03:52.315
Son of a bitch. The bear market's
already killing me and you say that?

03:52.815 --> 03:53.650
You wanna die?

03:54.400 --> 03:56.819
Wow! I was just going to say that.

03:56.903 --> 03:59.489
You remember the day So-hee died?

04:00.114 --> 04:02.200
You were Yeon-jin's alibi that day,
weren't you?

04:03.993 --> 04:05.995
What the fuck
are you getting at, dickhead?

04:06.079 --> 04:08.414
Moron. I've sent you
my crypto wallet address.

04:08.498 --> 04:10.250
You have 48 hours to send it.

04:10.333 --> 04:13.920
Ah, Jerkface Jae-Jun,
you're a real softie, huh?

04:14.003 --> 04:15.755
Hey… Hey…

04:15.838 --> 04:17.257
What the fuck?

04:28.434 --> 04:30.937
-What's up?
-Hey, it's your man, babe.

04:31.020 --> 04:31.854
Oh, fuck off.

04:31.938 --> 04:32.772
HYE-JEONG

04:32.855 --> 04:35.441
I could fuck you, if you'd like.

04:36.317 --> 04:38.569
So why don't we leave Korea together?

04:38.653 --> 04:40.446
Oh wow. So fucking cute.

04:40.530 --> 04:43.283
Yeah, I know you're so fucking cute, okay?

04:43.366 --> 04:45.368
That's why I'm trying to save you
right now.

04:45.910 --> 04:48.913
So, why'd you go to So-hee's academy
the day she died, huh?

04:48.997 --> 04:51.332
If you stay in Korea,
you'll get involved for sure.

04:51.416 --> 04:54.460
So let's leave, Hye-jeong,
to a place where we can be together.

04:55.503 --> 04:56.337
To Russia.

04:56.421 --> 04:57.338
My heels.

04:58.965 --> 05:00.717
Why are you going to Russia?

05:01.342 --> 05:03.845
Oh, did you actually decide
to become a dog?

05:03.928 --> 05:04.846
A sled dog?

05:04.929 --> 05:06.264
Hey! Fucking hell!

05:07.348 --> 05:10.101
I'll get you a first-class ticket,
you fucking bitch!

05:10.184 --> 05:13.146
You're the only person
who knows my tablet's passcode!

05:13.730 --> 05:16.107
Can't you see I like you? Can't you?

05:19.485 --> 05:20.611
I've got the chills.

05:21.863 --> 05:24.449
Oh! Gyeong-ran, do you have any fur coats?

05:24.532 --> 05:26.326
Hey, I've called all of them.

05:26.409 --> 05:27.285
OCTOBER 19TH

05:27.368 --> 05:30.038
Not one of them even batted an eye.

05:30.121 --> 05:32.373
What about Yeon-jin?
Did you set up a meeting?

05:32.457 --> 05:35.752
Well, actually,
I wanted to talk to you first.

05:36.753 --> 05:38.671
She'll be the next person
I call after you.

05:39.589 --> 05:40.590
So, then,

05:41.883 --> 05:45.053
does this mean you're including me
in the list of people you're calling?

05:45.136 --> 05:48.473
Wow, Dong-eun, you're so freaking smart.

05:49.390 --> 05:51.392
You see, Dong-eun.
I haven't told them about you.

05:52.226 --> 05:53.644
You know how they can be.

05:53.728 --> 05:56.147
They'd probably just go end you
on the spot.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.315
So, I'll get to my point…

05:57.398 --> 06:00.985
If you want to live to a ripe old age,
then give me the name tag, Dong-eun.

06:18.461 --> 06:20.838
EDEN APARTMENTS

06:32.642 --> 06:34.727
Imagine running into you here.

06:38.147 --> 06:40.358
If we knew we were supposed to bring a +1,

06:41.984 --> 06:44.695
we could've taken the same car.
Right, dear?

06:53.079 --> 06:56.916
I need to leave a sign
so that my friend knows I was here,

06:58.292 --> 06:59.836
but I haven't figured out how.

07:02.213 --> 07:05.049
So, tell me, honey,
what are you doing here?

07:06.426 --> 07:08.511
Did Dong-eun approach you too?

07:09.637 --> 07:12.473
Even if she did,
why would you dare come here?

07:12.557 --> 07:13.558
What?

07:14.892 --> 07:18.646
You've been with me, so now you want
to know what being with a teacher is like?

07:19.772 --> 07:21.441
You're the one I'm curious about.

07:25.194 --> 07:28.030
This place is all about you.

07:29.782 --> 07:30.700
Without a doubt.

07:47.550 --> 07:48.718
I'll ask you this once.

07:50.219 --> 07:52.472
And if you don't answer me,
I'll ask someone else.

07:53.055 --> 07:54.932
Have you ever bullied somebody

07:56.225 --> 07:58.060
and driven them to the brink of death?

07:58.978 --> 08:00.980
Did you verbally or physically…

08:02.732 --> 08:03.649
abuse them?

08:05.818 --> 08:07.612
So, you decided
to open the box after all?

08:08.696 --> 08:09.780
Really want to know?

08:13.868 --> 08:15.703
Did Ms. Moon do something to deserve that?

08:16.454 --> 08:17.538
Did she have to?

08:19.665 --> 08:20.583
I'm sorry?

08:20.666 --> 08:22.877
It's her side of the story
that I bullied her.

08:24.003 --> 08:26.672
We just never got on, that's all.

08:29.342 --> 08:30.927
I'm going to go now.

08:31.928 --> 08:33.429
Look around all you want.

08:45.107 --> 08:47.527
I'm the one who's disappointed
to see you here.

08:47.610 --> 08:49.278
Not the other way around.

09:42.415 --> 09:44.083
RAINBOW EYE CLINIC

10:18.326 --> 10:20.161
YOON SO-HEE, FEMALE
AGE 18

10:25.458 --> 10:27.209
What the hell were you thinking?

10:27.293 --> 10:30.171
How many times have I told you
that those bodies are not to be touched

10:30.254 --> 10:31.505
without my permission?

10:31.589 --> 10:35.593
I know that, sir, but I thought
since he's the son of the director…

10:37.386 --> 10:38.387
Just go.

10:44.060 --> 10:45.895
Are you Dr. Joo Yeo-jeong, then?

10:46.729 --> 10:48.564
I asked him to let me in.

10:48.648 --> 10:50.191
Do you have a minute to talk?

10:52.318 --> 10:55.029
Are you saying
Yoon So-hee's body is in the freezer?

10:56.739 --> 10:57.573
Yes.

10:58.199 --> 11:02.119
Our records say she's in the mortuary,
but her body's actually in the freezer.

11:02.203 --> 11:06.123
And this information is confidential
because it's an unprecedented situation.

11:06.207 --> 11:09.877
Excuse me,
but why are you so interested in this?

11:10.586 --> 11:11.921
For personal reasons.

11:13.964 --> 11:15.549
So, why'd the hospital do this?

11:16.092 --> 11:18.803
What's the real reason
for all these security measures?

11:18.886 --> 11:20.888
The real reason…

11:20.971 --> 11:21.931
I'm not sure.

11:22.431 --> 11:25.601
All I know is that the orders came
from the late director himself.

11:30.272 --> 11:31.440
From my father?

12:57.401 --> 12:58.736
Three, seven, two, four.

13:03.449 --> 13:05.868
I was so happy to see
that the lights were on.

13:05.951 --> 13:08.621
Did you wait long?
I told you to text me when you're here.

13:08.704 --> 13:09.789
I just got in.

13:10.289 --> 13:12.875
-You must've had a busy day.
-Oh, not really.

13:13.751 --> 13:15.211
I had some business back in Seoul.

13:16.712 --> 13:18.714
Actually, I got blue towels for you.

13:19.548 --> 13:21.258
Pink's the only thing
that looks good on me.

13:23.177 --> 13:25.346
Wow, you're going to check it right away?

13:25.971 --> 13:26.806
It does look good.

13:27.765 --> 13:28.933
You think so?

13:30.559 --> 13:32.728
Sorry, but I haven't
prepared the guest room yet.

13:32.812 --> 13:35.314
So you can sleep in my bed.
Tomorrow, we'll shop for yours.

13:35.856 --> 13:36.941
That's my room right there.

13:37.525 --> 13:39.944
I ordered something,
but I didn't get a bed.

13:40.027 --> 13:43.614
If I'm not here when it's delivered,
just leave it. I'll assemble it myself.

13:44.490 --> 13:45.825
So, what did you order?

13:49.995 --> 13:52.873
The cops want me to come in
for an interview. What do I do?

13:52.957 --> 13:54.917
What do you mean? It's just an interview.

13:55.000 --> 13:57.086
Why? Did you kill Myeong-o?

13:58.170 --> 13:59.338
You think I did too?

14:00.047 --> 14:02.299
Fuck me. Did I do it?

14:02.383 --> 14:04.468
Jeez, this is a new type of bullshit.

14:09.181 --> 14:11.100
I can't remember when I last saw him,

14:11.851 --> 14:14.436
or if I sent him back in one piece.

14:15.479 --> 14:18.858
Which is better?
Committing murder, or doing drugs?

14:18.941 --> 14:21.777
Just think, you could
accidentally murder someone,

14:21.861 --> 14:25.197
but can you accidentally take drugs?
That sounds weird, right?

14:25.698 --> 14:28.701
Sa-ra, let's hang up.
You're freaking annoying right now.

14:28.784 --> 14:31.579
They called you too?
When's your interview? Mine's next week.

14:31.662 --> 14:32.496
It's today.

14:33.539 --> 14:34.665
Guess he's here.

14:35.291 --> 14:36.208
Come in!

14:36.876 --> 14:37.793
Today?

14:37.877 --> 14:39.962
No way. Hey, put me on speaker.

14:40.045 --> 14:41.130
No, record it.

14:41.797 --> 14:43.132
I'm gonna hurl…

14:43.674 --> 14:45.384
Enough with the bullshit, please.

14:47.386 --> 14:48.387
Please, sit.

14:50.973 --> 14:52.391
I'm a very busy man,

14:53.392 --> 14:54.894
so I can't get to the station.

14:54.977 --> 14:57.313
Well, this gives me a chance
to visit a place like this.

14:57.813 --> 15:00.316
I'm Officer Choi Dong-gyu.
I called earlier.

15:00.816 --> 15:01.650
Ah.

15:02.318 --> 15:05.738
By the way, do you usually conduct
investigations when adults go missing?

15:05.821 --> 15:08.324
He's no longer just missing.
It's now a criminal case.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.910
It was discovered that Mr. Son
could be involved in narcotics.

15:12.077 --> 15:14.246
When was the last time
that you saw Mr. Son?

15:14.830 --> 15:17.791
I'm not sure.
He hasn't been to work in three weeks.

15:19.209 --> 15:21.211
He stopped showing up,
and you never looked for him?

15:22.379 --> 15:23.589
It was a good thing.

15:23.672 --> 15:26.550
He stopped coming in
right when I was about to fire him.

15:26.634 --> 15:28.052
He was a screwup, you know.

15:29.136 --> 15:31.639
It's so hard to fire someone nowadays.

15:32.264 --> 15:33.182
Yeah.

15:34.224 --> 15:36.894
Do you remember anything else
that might be helpful?

15:36.977 --> 15:38.854
Was he supposed to meet up with someone?

15:40.648 --> 15:42.358
Before he went missing,

15:42.441 --> 15:44.944
there was someone
who was looking everywhere for him.

15:45.611 --> 15:46.862
And who was that?

15:49.198 --> 15:52.284
The CEO of Jaepyeong Construction,
Ha Do-yeong.

15:53.911 --> 15:55.621
He even gave me his business card.

15:56.121 --> 15:59.458
He had this kind of mad look in his eyes.

16:01.877 --> 16:02.795
I wonder why.

16:03.504 --> 16:06.757
When it looks like there's another sun
in the sky next to the real sun,

16:06.840 --> 16:08.592
we call it a "sun dog."

16:08.676 --> 16:12.513
A sun dog is caused by the reflection
and refraction of sunlight

16:12.596 --> 16:15.099
on the tiny ice crystals in the air.

16:15.182 --> 16:18.769
We also call this murihae in Korean,
which means "many suns."

16:18.852 --> 16:21.689
Depending on how you look at it,
a sun dog could be seen

16:21.772 --> 16:23.065
as two suns or an illusion.

16:23.732 --> 16:27.987
I hope you all enjoy observing
this unique weather phenomenon today.

16:28.070 --> 16:29.488
Park Yeon-jin signing off.

16:35.494 --> 16:36.328
SA-RA

16:36.412 --> 16:38.831
Jae-jun, how was
your interview about Myeong-o?

16:42.751 --> 16:44.420
What is it? What are you doing?

17:00.894 --> 17:02.563
You should have asked for the passcode.

17:03.063 --> 17:04.898
Digital door locks are expensive.

17:04.982 --> 17:06.567
You're right. I should have.

17:07.359 --> 17:09.528
But it was even more expensive
to get it open.

17:09.611 --> 17:11.530
Maybe I should rip open your mouth,

17:12.031 --> 17:14.533
or break your hands
since you paid to open it?

17:15.159 --> 17:15.993
What?

17:17.036 --> 17:20.122
Let's take a seat. Mine's a coffee. Hot.

17:53.363 --> 17:55.324
I enjoyed looking around your place.

17:55.407 --> 17:56.909
You must've worked hard.

17:57.618 --> 18:00.370
The factory, GED,
even the Teacher Certification Exam?

18:02.289 --> 18:04.541
But you still live in a rented room.

18:06.210 --> 18:09.254
-Must've been hard to get close to me.
-So you've done your research.

18:12.007 --> 18:12.841
Fucking bitch.

18:13.425 --> 18:14.802
You're one to talk.

18:16.095 --> 18:17.805
Well, that was the only way.

18:18.472 --> 18:21.350
When I started all this,
I thought it'd be like Taken.

18:21.850 --> 18:23.769
Once I actually got started, though,

18:23.852 --> 18:26.855
I had to follow you guys around,
make money at the same time,

18:26.939 --> 18:28.607
and even transfer schools. Wow…

18:29.525 --> 18:30.359
It's a lot of work.

18:30.943 --> 18:32.027
Just shut up.

18:33.028 --> 18:35.697
If you really wanted
to get your revenge or whatever,

18:35.781 --> 18:38.117
you would have gone to the police already.

18:38.867 --> 18:42.246
But you're running your mouth
because you don't have a thing on me.

18:42.788 --> 18:44.373
Well, try all you want.

18:45.040 --> 18:46.208
With your bullshit.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.710
You don't ever listen, do you?

18:49.628 --> 18:50.963
I said I've been busy.

18:52.214 --> 18:54.216
You see, I posted this online,

18:54.800 --> 18:56.552
but it didn't get many views.

18:56.635 --> 18:58.595
Maybe I should mention your name.

19:08.564 --> 19:09.481
Post it.

19:10.149 --> 19:11.942
And make sure you put my name.

19:12.526 --> 19:14.444
Whatever it is,
I have a million ways to escape.

19:15.028 --> 19:15.863
Really?

19:16.947 --> 19:20.033
Can you escape from this too?

19:22.452 --> 19:24.288
INCIDENT REPORT

19:36.717 --> 19:37.551
MEDICAL RECORD

19:37.634 --> 19:39.678
WITHDRAWAL FORM
MOON DONG-EUN

19:46.351 --> 19:47.978
I'm gonna kill you.

19:48.061 --> 19:49.229
Wake up already.

19:50.522 --> 19:52.149
I should be the one killing you.

19:52.232 --> 19:53.734
You evil bitch.

19:55.652 --> 20:00.073
I changed my mind a hundred times
while I was coming here today.

20:00.157 --> 20:01.450
But I finally decided to do it.

20:03.202 --> 20:05.370
The reason I'm here today

20:06.121 --> 20:08.290
is to give you one last chance.

20:09.041 --> 20:10.375
And I'm only giving it

20:10.459 --> 20:13.378
because of the gesture of kindness
someone left at my door.

20:15.214 --> 20:16.757
What the hell are you saying?

20:16.840 --> 20:19.092
I'm saying,
you'll be the one going to the police.

20:20.052 --> 20:21.762
Take these and turn yourself in.

20:21.845 --> 20:23.513
Confess to everything,

20:24.264 --> 20:27.434
including what you did
to cover up the crimes you committed.

20:29.811 --> 20:30.646
Excuse me?

20:30.729 --> 20:32.522
If your punishment comes from me,

20:33.482 --> 20:35.400
it'll be a lot harsher, Yeon-jin.

20:35.484 --> 20:39.488
I'm going to pay you back
for the 18-year hell I lived through.

20:40.322 --> 20:42.157
You have to beg for forgiveness

20:43.033 --> 20:45.702
from me and your other victims
by turning yourself in.

20:45.786 --> 20:46.703
Then…

20:48.163 --> 20:50.249
I'll put an end to my revenge.

20:51.833 --> 20:52.668
Wow.

20:53.627 --> 20:54.795
How thoughtful.

20:56.213 --> 20:57.881
Why the hell would I do that?

20:57.965 --> 20:59.716
How would it end here?

21:00.592 --> 21:02.844
As soon as I go to the police,
it'll be in the news.

21:02.928 --> 21:05.013
And then it would be all over for me.

21:05.764 --> 21:07.683
Is that your genius plan, you crazy bitch?

21:09.184 --> 21:11.687
Also, I think
you've misunderstood something.

21:12.646 --> 21:14.564
I didn't do anything wrong, Dong-eun.

21:16.817 --> 21:18.485
"Nothing wrong?" Really?

21:18.568 --> 21:19.653
Nothing.

21:20.862 --> 21:23.865
You think your life is a living hell
because of me?

21:25.409 --> 21:26.702
That's bullshit.

21:27.703 --> 21:31.206
Your life has been a living hell
since the very moment you were born.

21:31.957 --> 21:34.042
Honestly, you should be thanking me.

21:34.126 --> 21:35.919
Because of me, you became a teacher.

21:36.003 --> 21:38.672
I'm the one who made you work hard
and turn your life around.

21:40.173 --> 21:41.341
Forgiveness?

21:42.676 --> 21:44.344
Who should forgive who?

21:44.928 --> 21:48.140
Why do the poor always believe in things

21:48.223 --> 21:50.517
like poetic justice or karma?

21:54.062 --> 21:56.648
Even if I have to pull you apart
piece by piece,

21:57.399 --> 22:00.819
I swear I'll find another curling iron
to use on you.

22:03.196 --> 22:04.031
Get lost.

22:08.660 --> 22:10.662
In a way, I'm grateful.

22:11.705 --> 22:14.458
Our meeting has completely erased
any guilt I had.

22:16.043 --> 22:18.378
It's also kind of nice
to see you like this.

22:19.379 --> 22:22.924
Your expression tells me
you're struggling. Unable to stay afloat.

22:25.177 --> 22:26.511
And you just threw away

22:27.679 --> 22:30.432
the very last chance your husband got you.

22:59.419 --> 23:01.421
I actually have a secret love child.

23:02.005 --> 23:04.091
Have you ever had
something precious taken from you?

23:14.226 --> 23:15.560
He went missing?

23:16.269 --> 23:17.354
Son Myeong-o?

23:17.437 --> 23:18.271
Yes.

23:18.855 --> 23:20.065
The Jongno Police Station

23:20.148 --> 23:23.276
wants to interview you
as a witness to his disappearance.

23:24.569 --> 23:25.654
I'm sorry, sir,

23:26.154 --> 23:30.992
but there was something else
Mr. Son wanted me to tell you that day.

23:46.133 --> 23:47.217
Ms. Secretary,

23:47.300 --> 23:51.805
I have information on the motherfucker
that has been fucking your boss's wife.

23:51.888 --> 23:57.060
So tell your boss to call me right now
unless he wants to read about it online.

24:26.131 --> 24:27.966
All right. All done.

24:32.846 --> 24:33.763
Oh my God!

24:35.849 --> 24:36.850
Hey there…

24:39.978 --> 24:42.397
I just wanted to peek
inside the box, I swear.

24:42.481 --> 24:45.942
I told myself, "Don't assemble it,
even if you find a manual inside."

24:46.026 --> 24:48.195
"I used to be a Boy Scout,
but don't do it."

24:48.278 --> 24:50.989
Why didn't you assemble this
on the second floor?

24:51.490 --> 24:54.993
Or did you not consider it might be
harder to move once it's assembled?

24:56.578 --> 24:57.662
Ah, that's right…

25:03.126 --> 25:05.086
You're right. Totally right.

25:06.338 --> 25:08.965
-We can just leave it here--
-I don't want to impose.

25:09.674 --> 25:11.092
Let's move it after we eat.

25:12.344 --> 25:13.178
I got dessert.

25:17.265 --> 25:20.018
Whoa! Roasted sweet potatoes
are my absolute favorite.

25:21.061 --> 25:25.649
-You said noodles were your favorite.
-They are. This is my second favorite…

25:33.406 --> 25:34.741
That one's not a lie.

26:01.184 --> 26:03.019
Look at all of these sparkling walls…

26:04.354 --> 26:06.273
not yellowed by cigarette smoke,

26:06.773 --> 26:08.441
or infected with mold…

26:09.526 --> 26:12.529
None of these walls are stained by hatred.

26:16.491 --> 26:18.243
How strange this all is.

27:03.913 --> 27:07.334
How about your walls?
Are they still shiny and sturdy,

27:08.293 --> 27:09.294
Yeon-jin?

27:27.896 --> 27:30.065
Sit here. Next to the fire to stay warm.

27:32.609 --> 27:33.443
Use this.

27:35.278 --> 27:36.946
Do we have to eat out here in the cold?

27:37.030 --> 27:39.991
Well, this is exactly why
I got a house with a yard.

27:40.075 --> 27:41.117
Isn't it romantic?

27:41.201 --> 27:45.080
When I see houses like this, I think,
"The heating bills must be high."

27:45.163 --> 27:49.334
"The electricity bills must be insane
if they keep all those lights on."

27:51.461 --> 27:54.714
I'll pay my share of the costs,
but we're not splitting them equally.

27:54.798 --> 27:57.717
If we do that, I'll turn off those lights
and turn down the heat.

27:58.218 --> 27:59.052
Jeez.

28:00.095 --> 28:00.929
That's fine.

28:02.597 --> 28:04.140
They're just for today, then.

28:07.519 --> 28:09.354
Here. Dip it in.

28:15.026 --> 28:16.945
When did you learn how to do this?

28:18.113 --> 28:19.197
Well…

28:20.782 --> 28:22.784
I learned this morning.

28:25.328 --> 28:28.748
I looked up ideas
for some romantic dinners.

28:32.502 --> 28:33.628
Thank you for this.

28:35.380 --> 28:37.799
If this is all really
that important to you,

28:38.591 --> 28:40.009
then let's try being romantic.

28:41.344 --> 28:42.178
Really?

28:43.513 --> 28:45.515
-Should I play some music?
-No.

28:45.598 --> 28:47.183
I can just sing for you, then.

28:49.394 --> 28:50.729
Can I take back what I just said?

28:51.604 --> 28:53.064
No.

28:58.403 --> 29:00.238
Oh, maybe I have a cold.

29:01.239 --> 29:02.657
I might have a fever.

29:03.575 --> 29:04.743
Should we go in?

29:06.077 --> 29:07.078
Let's see.

29:23.261 --> 29:25.180
In my professional opinion,

29:25.889 --> 29:26.806
you're faking it.

29:29.851 --> 29:31.519
Did you have to check it right away?

29:34.773 --> 29:35.774
I'll let you off.

29:37.108 --> 29:39.277
You're missing out. I sing like a bird.

29:45.033 --> 29:46.367
Thank you for taking me in.

29:47.911 --> 29:50.246
You must've been surprised and confused.

29:50.330 --> 29:53.166
It was only right
to obey your royal command.

30:01.674 --> 30:02.509
Drugs?

30:03.009 --> 30:05.470
Myeong-o's case turned
into a drug investigation?

30:05.553 --> 30:07.055
Fuck me.

30:07.889 --> 30:10.391
I knew this would fucking happen! Damn!

30:11.351 --> 30:13.520
Shit. Look what you've done.

30:13.603 --> 30:16.564
This is all 'cause you called the cops,
you fucking bitch.

30:16.648 --> 30:17.565
Let go! My hair!

30:18.191 --> 30:21.194
Maybe you shouldn't have taken drugs
in the first fucking place!

30:21.277 --> 30:22.362
-Bitch!
-Hey, hey, hey.

30:22.946 --> 30:26.324
I know you're going through withdrawal,
but your drug problems are on you.

30:27.283 --> 30:28.701
It's about time you realize that.

30:28.785 --> 30:29.702
Ah, shit!

30:33.581 --> 30:35.333
We can't turn against each other now.

30:35.917 --> 30:38.920
Moon Dong-eun is really
coming after us now.

30:40.004 --> 30:41.422
WITHDRAWAL FORM

30:41.506 --> 30:42.423
INCIDENT REPORT

30:43.925 --> 30:45.009
What about it?

30:45.093 --> 30:46.511
Are you serious?

30:47.387 --> 30:49.514
She collected evidence
about how we bullied her!

30:49.597 --> 30:51.349
And that's my problem how?

30:52.100 --> 30:55.520
You're the one who'll be affected by it,
not normal people like us.

30:59.148 --> 31:00.733
I couldn't care less about any of this.

31:03.486 --> 31:05.405
I'm going to ask
since it's been bothering me.

31:05.488 --> 31:07.323
Did Myeong-o ask any of you
about Yoon So-hee?

31:10.660 --> 31:11.578
You too?

31:12.704 --> 31:13.872
You too?

31:13.955 --> 31:14.998
Oh, wow…

31:15.081 --> 31:17.250
He asked why I went
to So-hee's academy that day.

31:17.333 --> 31:19.168
So, he called each of us?

31:20.169 --> 31:21.379
And now he's gone missing?

31:22.338 --> 31:24.048
I almost told him that

31:24.924 --> 31:27.051
Yeon-jin was the one who asked me to go.

31:28.803 --> 31:31.222
What are you suggesting, Hye-jeong?

31:31.306 --> 31:33.641
I spent that entire day with Jae-Jun.

31:34.559 --> 31:36.811
Back then,
we were all unfairly investigated.

31:37.312 --> 31:38.563
Don't we all agree on that?

31:39.939 --> 31:41.024
And now it's "we."

31:44.152 --> 31:47.739
The best-case scenario for you right now
is not a lawsuit.

31:47.822 --> 31:49.574
It's the mother's divorce.

31:52.577 --> 31:53.745
Where were we that day?

31:55.288 --> 31:56.581
Together.

31:59.292 --> 32:00.877
We were in the DVD room,

32:01.502 --> 32:03.588
watching some naughty movies together.

32:07.216 --> 32:08.551
So, we were being naughty, huh?

32:10.136 --> 32:11.387
You expect us to believe that?

32:11.471 --> 32:13.348
No one's willing to say it out loud,

32:13.431 --> 32:15.141
but didn't you do something to So-hee?

32:15.224 --> 32:16.059
Sa-ra.

32:17.769 --> 32:19.938
I don't think you know what you're saying.

32:20.605 --> 32:21.606
Bite your tongue.

32:22.649 --> 32:23.483
So, then,

32:24.192 --> 32:26.527
what did Myeong-o have to say to you?

32:26.611 --> 32:29.280
What did he ask you about So-hee?

32:53.304 --> 32:55.264
You've all totally lost it.

33:00.561 --> 33:01.729
Fuck you all.

33:24.877 --> 33:26.045
It's me, Mr. Shin.

33:27.088 --> 33:28.756
Remember my name tag back then?

33:34.637 --> 33:37.557
TO THE DETECTIVE
IN CHARGE OF YOON SO-HEE'S CASE

33:38.683 --> 33:40.810
COMPLAINT BOX

33:44.939 --> 33:47.942
You know it's hard to get a membership
for the Western CC, right?

33:48.026 --> 33:50.987
Hey, I didn't just win this
by gambling either.

33:54.532 --> 33:55.408
How'd you wrap it up?

33:55.491 --> 33:58.453
I made sure it was ruled a suicide.
Don't worry.

33:59.537 --> 34:02.457
You know,
if you weren't so good at studying,

34:02.540 --> 34:04.917
your face would've been all over the news.

34:07.295 --> 34:08.629
PARK YEON-JIN

34:09.213 --> 34:10.381
I'll just burn this.

34:11.132 --> 34:12.133
It's bad luck.

34:13.551 --> 34:15.136
Back then, I was far too naïve.

34:16.804 --> 34:18.890
I thought they would
reopen the investigation

34:18.973 --> 34:22.602
if additional evidence was discovered,
but nothing ever happened.

34:23.686 --> 34:26.439
The name tag
wasn't even on the list of evidence.

34:27.106 --> 34:28.941
Then the one you had wasn't real.

34:29.442 --> 34:31.944
So, why did you tell Mr. Son
about the name tag?

34:32.028 --> 34:34.822
Because Myeong-o didn't know it was fake.

34:36.199 --> 34:38.785
I just needed some bait
to make him start swimming.

34:39.452 --> 34:42.371
Where exactly did you want Mr. Son to go?

34:44.415 --> 34:45.416
To Yeon-jin.

34:48.669 --> 34:50.588
You're saying the same thing
over and over.

34:50.671 --> 34:52.465
Park Yeon-jin, the weather forecaster,

34:52.548 --> 34:54.759
was somehow involved
in Son's disappearance,

34:55.259 --> 34:58.679
but you have no evidence to support
this claim. Am I getting that right?

34:59.680 --> 35:03.184
I have to find the evidence too?
I've just given you information.

35:03.267 --> 35:05.895
Well, 99% of these tip-offs
turn out to be false.

35:06.604 --> 35:09.273
And making a false accusation
is a serious crime.

35:10.525 --> 35:14.654
Now, all I want to know is
if Mr. Son had anything to do with drugs.

35:14.737 --> 35:16.405
Do you know anything about that?

35:18.407 --> 35:19.742
I'll think about it.

35:20.493 --> 35:22.912
Does that mean you know something,
or you don't?

35:22.995 --> 35:25.957
I don't know if what I know
is a false accusation or not,

35:26.040 --> 35:27.458
so I'll think about it.

35:27.542 --> 35:30.795
After all, I shouldn't commit
such a serious crime.

35:36.134 --> 35:37.468
And what about the name tag?

35:38.136 --> 35:40.638
Wasn't it sent anonymously 18 years ago?

35:40.721 --> 35:43.975
If it was dropped off at the station,
then there must've been a witness.

35:44.475 --> 35:46.477
Did you even try
to conduct an investigation?

35:50.398 --> 35:52.316
You're blaming me for not investigating?

35:52.984 --> 35:54.735
For not escalating the situation?

35:55.319 --> 35:57.655
Do you want me to spend
my life living in fear?

35:58.573 --> 35:59.991
What if the witness shows up?

36:00.908 --> 36:01.909
After this long?

36:02.702 --> 36:04.954
You said it yourself. It was anonymous.

36:05.037 --> 36:07.498
If they were going to show up,
they would've back then.

36:07.582 --> 36:09.417
But what if there's more evidence?

36:10.168 --> 36:12.587
What if the witness suddenly goes crazy

36:12.670 --> 36:15.006
and decides to become a hero tomorrow?

36:20.845 --> 36:22.597
It's been 18 years, Yeon-jin.

36:22.680 --> 36:26.434
Your mother got rid of the name tag
long ago. Only the corpse remains.

36:26.517 --> 36:29.478
And that corpse has been sitting
in the mortuary rotting away.

36:29.562 --> 36:32.064
Even if they decide
to reopen the case tomorrow,

36:32.148 --> 36:33.983
it was already ruled as a suicide.

36:35.943 --> 36:39.530
There's no way they will flip that.
So, what's the problem?

36:43.117 --> 36:45.369
Right? That's true, right?

36:46.245 --> 36:48.581
That's exactly what I wanted to hear.

36:51.167 --> 36:53.753
By the way,
where's the motel that you took over?

36:54.420 --> 36:56.589
Is it that one? Oh, is it that one?

36:58.216 --> 36:59.050
Right.

37:00.134 --> 37:02.803
Thank you for getting
the registration for that car.

37:29.288 --> 37:30.122
Don't do it.

37:30.623 --> 37:32.875
You'll only get beaten up
if you go in, Mom.

37:32.959 --> 37:34.377
That won't do us any good.

37:35.086 --> 37:37.088
He bought four bottles of soju.

37:37.588 --> 37:39.257
He won't fall asleep for a while.

38:05.908 --> 38:07.159
My Sun-a,

38:07.743 --> 38:10.079
how are you so bright and beautiful

38:11.038 --> 38:13.749
after growing up in such an awful place?

38:13.833 --> 38:15.918
Do you remember the one thing I hate most?

38:17.336 --> 38:18.170
Tearjokers.

38:18.879 --> 38:20.047
"Jerkers."

38:21.465 --> 38:23.134
Right. That's it.

38:27.221 --> 38:28.306
I'm sorry.

38:30.266 --> 38:32.518
I'm so, so sorry.

38:33.019 --> 38:35.104
You have nothing to be sorry for.

38:36.897 --> 38:38.149
Don't cry, Mom.

38:40.318 --> 38:41.986
None of this is your fault.

38:42.486 --> 38:44.905
You're trying your best every single day.

38:47.992 --> 38:48.826
Sun-a…

38:51.746 --> 38:52.580
do you

38:53.914 --> 38:54.999
want to

38:56.334 --> 38:57.918
go somewhere

38:58.794 --> 39:00.046
far away from here?

39:01.172 --> 39:02.173
To study?

39:03.841 --> 39:06.927
The US isn't that far.
It's not like I'd be walking there.

39:07.887 --> 39:09.722
Promise you'll come join me soon?

39:11.682 --> 39:12.600
Sure.

39:12.683 --> 39:13.559
Of course.

39:14.685 --> 39:18.356
You go first, then Ms. Moon
and I will follow you.

39:19.482 --> 39:23.069
You should go to school there,
become a cheerleader,

39:23.569 --> 39:25.780
and date the captain of the football team.

39:27.656 --> 39:29.742
What kind of movies
have you been watching?

39:40.503 --> 39:45.007
Sun-a's name means "kind" and "pure."

39:45.841 --> 39:47.426
I chose her name myself.

39:48.761 --> 39:51.722
Maybe her life's hard
because I didn't pick the right name.

39:51.806 --> 39:52.640
KANG HYEON-NAM

39:52.723 --> 39:55.393
Maybe I should have paid someone
to name her.

39:56.310 --> 40:00.773
But in the US, Sun-a will get
a new English name, won't she?

40:01.982 --> 40:03.067
That's all I need.

40:04.735 --> 40:06.320
That's all I need, Ms. Moon.

40:07.279 --> 40:09.281
BEWARE OF INFECTION

40:14.286 --> 40:15.287
Wow, four hours?

40:15.371 --> 40:16.497
OPERATION TIME

40:16.580 --> 40:18.082
Still haven't lost your touch.

40:18.165 --> 40:20.751
A TA patient.
Just trying to stop the bleeding.

40:22.253 --> 40:25.214
What's up? You didn't even call ahead.

40:25.297 --> 40:26.215
Need more money?

40:26.298 --> 40:29.135
Hey, that's not why.
I'm here for business.

40:29.218 --> 40:31.137
What business do you have in my hospital?

40:31.720 --> 40:32.680
I'm here to see you.

40:33.639 --> 40:34.765
I've missed you, Mom.

40:35.975 --> 40:38.394
-You'll get blood on you!
-So?

40:38.477 --> 40:40.479
You definitely ran out of money.

40:46.277 --> 40:47.361
Hey, Mom,

40:48.612 --> 40:51.449
if I used my scalpel
as a headsman's sword,

40:52.533 --> 40:53.868
would you stop me?

40:58.330 --> 40:59.415
What're you saying?

40:59.999 --> 41:03.627
What if I decided to make
a different choice than Dad?

41:07.131 --> 41:10.759
The person I like went through
something really horrible.

41:11.760 --> 41:13.596
And I want to help her get revenge.

41:17.516 --> 41:18.893
Because I'm bored.

41:18.976 --> 41:21.353
So, is your son going through hell?

41:23.981 --> 41:24.982
That asshole.

41:27.109 --> 41:30.696
He raped, assaulted, and murdered.

41:32.656 --> 41:35.493
But he still tried to save him
like any other patient.

41:38.496 --> 41:39.497
Your father…

41:43.667 --> 41:44.835
was a very good man.

41:46.003 --> 41:47.588
So kind and warm-hearted.

41:48.672 --> 41:49.507
But

41:50.799 --> 41:54.261
blindly pursuing morals and goodwill
only brings you false glory,

41:54.345 --> 41:55.429
nothing more.

41:59.308 --> 42:02.895
I always thought you took after
your father, but I can see I was wrong.

42:02.978 --> 42:04.313
You're far more like me.

42:08.526 --> 42:09.360
You wanna help?

42:13.447 --> 42:14.615
Don't get caught then.

42:16.116 --> 42:18.077
If that would bring you heavenly peace,

42:19.537 --> 42:20.955
I'm not going to stop you.

42:27.127 --> 42:28.128
No one will know.

42:29.880 --> 42:30.714
Here you go.

42:31.549 --> 42:34.218
By the way, did Yeon-jin
really break into your house?

42:34.718 --> 42:35.636
My God.

42:36.178 --> 42:37.680
Did she take anything?

42:37.763 --> 42:40.099
What do I have that she'd want to steal?

42:41.016 --> 42:43.185
I left the only thing
I was worried about with you.

42:43.811 --> 42:44.979
What is this, then?

42:45.729 --> 42:47.815
So-hee's incident report.

42:48.607 --> 42:50.943
This is why
I shared everything with Myeong-o.

42:53.237 --> 42:55.531
But how did you get your hands on this?

43:08.419 --> 43:11.213
WINTER OF 2011

43:15.509 --> 43:16.760
DO YOU KNOW SO-HEE?

43:18.345 --> 43:19.680
MY DAUGHTER, YOON SO-HEE?

43:19.763 --> 43:20.806
DECEASED: YOON SO-HEE

43:20.889 --> 43:24.184
PLEASE READ THIS
I'M BEGGING YOU

43:24.268 --> 43:26.353
NOBODY LISTENS TO ME

43:26.437 --> 43:30.190
DO YOU KNOW PARK YEON-JIN?
DO YOU KNOW SON MYEONG-O?

43:30.274 --> 43:31.942
THEY KILLED MY DAUGHTER

43:32.026 --> 43:33.694
NO ONE CAN HELP ME

43:33.777 --> 43:37.573
DO YOU KNOW JEON JAE-JUN?
LEE SA-RA? CHOI HYE-JEONG?

43:37.656 --> 43:43.078
MISS, PLEASE READ THIS

43:46.081 --> 43:48.375
This is the autopsy report
for Yoon So-hee.

43:48.876 --> 43:50.336
It was performed at our hospital.

43:50.419 --> 43:51.503
EIGHT WEEKS INTO PREGNANCY

43:52.546 --> 43:53.380
So Yoon So-hee…

43:54.840 --> 43:56.175
was pregnant.

43:56.258 --> 43:58.427
Pregnant? So-hee was?

43:59.053 --> 43:59.887
Yeah.

44:00.596 --> 44:04.266
That's why I asked her
to hand the incident report over to me.

44:04.767 --> 44:08.771
I told her
that I'll bring So-hee back home.

44:10.606 --> 44:13.859
That I'm going to get revenge for her too.

44:16.153 --> 44:19.740
I think that may be why I'm still alive.

44:21.283 --> 44:23.410
There were so many times
when I wanted to die.

44:26.955 --> 44:28.374
You won't believe me,

44:29.375 --> 44:32.795
but I think So-hee was helping me
fall asleep every night.

44:35.673 --> 44:38.008
And because of her
I felt better once I woke up.

44:39.677 --> 44:40.678
I just…

44:45.015 --> 44:46.517
You poor thing, Dong-eun.

44:49.019 --> 44:51.355
I feel horrible for you and So-hee.

45:16.463 --> 45:19.967
If you want to live to a ripe old age,
then give me the name tag, Dong-eun.

45:21.301 --> 45:23.303
I guess we're not
in the same boat anymore, are we?

45:23.387 --> 45:25.556
What else am I to do?
That ship's way off course.

45:26.807 --> 45:28.559
So think carefully, Dong-eun.

45:28.642 --> 45:31.478
What if I decide to switch teams on you?

45:32.396 --> 45:36.316
I mean, would you even stand a chance
against four people ganging up on you?

45:37.151 --> 45:39.319
You know they're all murderers, right?

45:40.529 --> 45:42.281
They're the ones who killed So-hee.

45:42.781 --> 45:44.783
I'm the only one who's innocent, right?

45:44.867 --> 45:46.243
You think you're innocent?

45:46.910 --> 45:48.579
Why are you putting it like that?

45:49.246 --> 45:50.330
What am I guilty of?

45:50.414 --> 45:52.958
A crime for which you deserve
to be torn limb from limb.

45:53.625 --> 45:55.377
I survived against the five of you.

45:57.087 --> 45:58.255
So good luck.

46:00.382 --> 46:01.800
Hey! You fucking bitch.

46:02.342 --> 46:03.677
How annoying.

46:05.763 --> 46:07.848
Ah, shit. This isn't good.

46:09.099 --> 46:12.519
No, wait. I just need
Yeon-jin to take the bait.

46:22.529 --> 46:23.781
I've been

46:23.864 --> 46:26.450
thinking about you all day.

46:27.201 --> 46:28.285
Want to meet up?

46:29.036 --> 46:31.371
I have something really important
to talk about.

46:31.872 --> 46:33.624
If you don't meet with me today,

46:33.707 --> 46:36.293
then I'll go to your workplace tomorrow.

46:39.379 --> 46:40.631
Now I'm curious.

46:41.882 --> 46:43.217
Why do you want to see me?

46:46.220 --> 46:48.305
Now is not a good time.
I'm at a gathering.

46:51.391 --> 46:52.643
Want to meet around 11?

47:13.539 --> 47:14.498
YEONGSAN FUNERAL HOME

48:21.440 --> 48:23.817
PARK YEON-JIN

